+<!-- 5. MANUAL VS AI-POWERED -->
+<section class="sec sec--cloud" aria-labelledby="cmp-title">
+  <div class="wrap">
+    <div class="sec__head">
+      <p class="eyebrow" data-reveal>Why Add AI</p>
+      <h2 class="h2 split" id="cmp-title">Manual Entry vs.<br><span class="grad-text">AI-Powered Extraction</span></h2>
+      <div class="sec__side" data-reveal style="--d:120"><p class="lede">Same records and the same paper process on the floor. The difference is that the data is ready when the next question arrives.</p></div>
+    </div>
+    <div class="compare" data-observe>
+      <div class="compare__col compare__col--before"><p class="compare__label">Manual transcription</p><ul class="compare__list">
+        <li style="--i:0"><span><em class="strike">Values re-keyed into Excel for every batch and every question</em></span></li>
+        <li style="--i:1"><span><em class="strike">Only the steps tied to the current investigation get transcribed</em></span></li>
+        <li style="--i:2"><span><em class="strike">Units, names, and dates reconciled by hand</em></span></li>
+        <li style="--i:3"><span><em class="strike">Each analysis ends in a one-off spreadsheet on someone's drive</em></span></li>
+        <li style="--i:4"><span><em class="strike">Archived records stay unreadable images</em></span></li>
+      </ul></div>
+      <div class="compare__col compare__col--after" data-spot><p class="compare__label">With AI-powered extraction</p><ul class="compare__list">
+        <li style="--i:0">Printed fields, handwriting, tables, and signatures extracted for you</li>
+        <li style="--i:1">The full record captured, from raw materials to final sign-off</li>
+        <li style="--i:2">Uncertain values confirmed by a person before they are published</li>
+        <li style="--i:3">Every batch extends one growing repository</li>
+        <li style="--i:4">Years of archived records can be scanned in and searched</li>
+      </ul></div>
+    </div>
+    <div class="cats" data-reveal style="--d:120"><span class="cats__label">Use it for</span><span class="cats__pill">Deviation and OOS investigations</span><span class="cats__pill">Trending and process verification</span><span class="cats__pill">Annual Product Review</span><span class="cats__pill">Audit and inspection readiness</span></div>
+  </div>
+</section>
