+# Life Sciences Webinar 3 — Turn Paper Batch Records into Searchable Data
+
+CMC Intelligence Series, Session 03. Reference HTML: `avahi-life-sciences-paper-batch-records-webinar-vsl.html` (repo root).
+Design reference: Webinar 2 (`/life-sciences-webinar-2-batch-record-review`, content id 228075035449).
+
+## HubSpot page
+
+| Item | Value |
+|---|---|
+| Page | "Avahi \| Life Sciences Webinar 3 – Paper Batch Records to Searchable Data", content id **228093785624** (DRAFT, cloned from Webinar 2 on 2026-11-20) |
+| URL (after publish) | https://www2.avahi.ai/life-sciences-webinar-3-paper-batch-records |
+| Template | `avahi-global/templates/avahi-landing-page.html` — global header + footer partials (not copied, not changed) |
+| Title / OG title | Paper Batch Records to Searchable Data Webinar \| Avahi |
+| Meta / OG description | Watch AWS-based extraction turn executed paper batch records into one searchable repository, with every value linked back to its source page. Book a call with Avahi. |
+| Canonical | automatic (page URL); indexable (no robots tag) |
+| Featured / OG image | File Manager `/avahi-ls-webinar-3/avahi-ls-webinar-3-turn-paper-into-searchable-data.jpg` (1536×864), alt set; head HTML adds og:type, og:site_name, og:image:alt, twitter:image:alt |
+| Meetings | `https://meetings.hubspot.com/baljit-singh2/life-sciences?embed=true&uuid=6babea09-8ec4-468d-9579-a6c83c6e8911` |
+| Video | **Not connected.** DLD-250 (video edit) was "In Progress" on 2026-11-20. Poster = thumbnail; with no video, a click on the player scrolls to the booking section. |
+
+## Modules (same as Webinar 2, content set as page values)
+
+`avahi_lsv_layer` (locked CSS/JS), `avahi_lsv_hero`, `avahi_lsv_results`, `avahi_lsv_booking`, `avahi_lsv_timeline`,
+`avahi_lsv_compare`, `avahi_lsv_dark_panel`, `avahi_lsv_presenters`, `avahi_lsv_series`, `avahi_awards_rail`,
+`avahi_lsv_cta` (+ floating "Talk to an AI Expert"), `avahi_faq`. All values: `page-values.json`.
+
+Page-specific choices:
+* Hero video: poster = thumbnail, overlay text off (as on Webinar 2), **phone shape 16:9** (4:3 cropped the faces in
+  the thumbnail), play button "Lower".
+* Series: Session 02 card links to the live Webinar 2 page (the reference had no link because it was not live yet).
+
+## Module additions (2026-11-20, backwards compatible)
+
+Webinar 3 uses icons and a dark-panel scene that the Webinar 2 modules did not have. Added (nothing removed or renamed;
+Webinar 2 output verified unchanged):
+
+* `avahi_lsv_results`, `avahi_lsv_timeline`: icon choices `trend`, `flask`, `clock`, `signature`, `search`, `database`
+  (`snippets/icon-branches.hubl.html`, `snippets/icon-choices.json`).
+* `avahi_lsv_dark_panel`: scene choice `trace` ("Paper record to searchable data scene (Session 03)",
+  `snippets/dark-panel-trace-scene.svg.html`) + a scoped `.lsv .ill .lp-pulse` animation (reduced-motion safe),
+  printed only when that scene is chosen.
+* Applied with `tools/module-additions.js` in a logged-in app.hubspot.com tab (CMS Source Code API PUT); read back and
+  compared after upload.
+* Rollback copies of the 3 modules before the change: Design Manager
+  `custom/content-mcp/_backup-2026-11-20/<module>.module/` (hidden from new content).
+
+## Assets (File Manager `/avahi-ls-webinar-3/`)
+
+Thumbnail (JPG from the supplied PNG), AWS partner logo, Baljit Singh and Nipun Sibal photos — extracted from the
+reference HTML (`assets/`). The hero AWS logo and the 7 award images are the same files Webinar 2 uses.
+
+## QA (draft preview, 2026-11-20)
+
+* Widths 1536, 1280, 1024, 768, 430/390, 360: no horizontal overflow, nothing left unrevealed, calendar card fits
+  (355px at 390), video 16:9 on phones.
+* 1 H1, H2 per section; Manrope; 48 images load; global header (1) + footer (1); new icons and scene render.
+* Meetings iframe loads with the Baljit Singh link; FAQ accordion (6) opens/closes; `#book`, `#watch` anchors exist;
+  series links 01 and 02 work; no console errors.
+* Title, single description, canonical, og:title, og:image (thumbnail), twitter card present; no robots tag.
+* Webinar 2 live page re-checked after the module change: same heading, 12 icons, original scene.
+
+## To do
+
